+# UI Studio v0.15 — verification record (2026-10-24)
+
+## Status: CORE VERIFIED / BROWSER E2E UNVERIFIED
+
+This archive is a **v0.15 candidate**, not a CI-verified release. The previous v0.14 baseline is verified by GitHub Actions [run 40063374176](https://github.com/nssang00/chatgpt-write-test/actions/runs/40063374176), commit `1687fc5ba36d97d95f00524adb32f4477125017d`. This candidate is derived from that standalone source archive.
+
+## Changes in scope
+
+- Selection breadcrumbs for root/parent/child navigation, including nested layout and slot nodes.
+- Duplicate selected component, nested frame or filled slot, retaining layout/props/bindings/events and remapping all descendant IDs; root duplication forbidden.
+- Shortcuts: Ctrl/Cmd+D duplicate, Delete/Backspace remove, Ctrl/Cmd+Z undo, Ctrl/Cmd+Shift+Z / Ctrl+Y redo. Disabled while editing text or inside modals; structural actions only in Design mode.
+- Action toolbar and Undo/Redo availability indicators.
+- No canonical document schema migration, runtime protocol, or exporter semantics changes.
+
+## Executed checks (same source, local Node.js 22)
+
+| Check | Observed result |
+|---|---|
+| `npm test` | **188 passed, 0 failed, 0 skipped** (183 baseline + 5 new v0.15 tests) |
+| `node tools/verify-syntax.mjs` | **53 source files + 3 generated TSX, zero syntax errors** |
+| `npm run verify:runtime` | **PASS**: JSX runtime, independent instances, state, public events, slots, dynamic repeat, nested components |
+| `npm run export:v014` | **PASS**: portable CustomerBrowser archive generated, 25 files |
+| `python tools/check-export-structure.py examples/CustomerBrowser-react-component-v0.13.zip` | **PASS**: ZIP CRC, 25 files, 46 local import paths resolvable |
+| Source diff reconstruction | **PASS**: v0.15 patch applied to unmodified v0.14 baseline, 188 Core tests passed |
+
+## Not verified here (release blockers)
+
+- `npm run build` (Vite production build), because the local container does not have project npm dependencies and its npm registry cannot be resolved.
+- Playwright Chrome Studio v0.15 scenarios (`e2e/editing-v015.spec.js`, 2 added) and the 11 prior Studio scenarios were **not run** on this v0.15 candidate.
+- Standalone React Consumer Vite build and real-Chrome E2E were **not run** on this v0.15 candidate.
+- The original v0.14 CI success cannot be generalized to these new v0.15 source changes.
+
+## Full verification to complete before calling v0.15 a verified baseline
+
+```bash
+npm install --no-audit --no-fund
+npm test
+node tools/verify-syntax.mjs
+npm run verify:runtime
+npm run build
+npm run export:v014
+python tools/check-export-structure.py examples/CustomerBrowser-react-component-v0.13.zip
+CI=true UI_STUDIO_USE_SYSTEM_CHROME=1 npm run test:e2e
+mkdir -p tests/component-v014
+unzip -q -o examples/CustomerBrowser-react-component-v0.13.zip -d tests/component-v014
+(cd tests/component-v014 && npm install --no-audit --no-fund && npm run build && npm pack --pack-destination ../consumer-v013)
+(cd tests/consumer-v013 && npm install --no-audit --no-fund && npm run build)
+CI=true UI_STUDIO_USE_SYSTEM_CHROME=1 npx playwright test --config=e2e/consumer-v013.config.js
+```
+
+A ready-to-run workflow for a repository that contains the standalone application at its root is included at `.github/workflows/v015-verification.yml`. It has **not** been run.
+
+Expected Studio suite count: 13 = 11 prior + 2 new; independent Consumer suite count: 1. Treat only an actual successful run as evidence, not this expectation.
+
+## Packaging / provenance
+
+- Original source: `ui-studio-v014-verified-baseline-20261024.zip`.
+- Standalone v0.15 ZIP: `ui-studio-v015-editing-candidate-20261024.zip`.
+- The companion patch `ui-studio-v015-editing-from-v014.patch` is a unified diff from the exact extracted v0.14 baseline to this candidate (source/UX/tests), excluding this verification note and manifest.
+- `SHA256SUMS.txt` contains digests for every file in the candidate ZIP except itself.
